{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>לעגלות</b> — these are the golden calves in Bethel." "<b>יגורו</b> — the inhabitants of Samaria will fear." "<b>כי אבל עליו</b> — the meaning: over each calf in Bethel when it is destroyed." "<b>וכמריו</b> — those who rejoiced over it today will mourn." "<b>כי</b> — the meaning is doubled."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:46.498094397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}